You little...

00:19:26.839 --> 00:19:28.359
Still think you can keep your Princess in?

00:19:42.559 --> 00:19:43.720
Who is A Lan waiting for?

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:47.759
Why are you here?

00:19:48.599 --> 00:19:49.359
If I didn't come,

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.920
you wouldn't think to look for me.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.720
The palace guards are truly useless.

00:19:54.319 --> 00:19:56.359
Is everything alright for you in Jingzhou?

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:58.599
With you gone,

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:00.319
of course it's not good.

00:20:02.079 --> 00:20:03.759
Can you be serious for once?

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:05.279
Is Yinglu doing alright?

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:06.680
I even brought her a gift.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:08.960
She's doing great.

00:20:09.799 --> 00:20:11.519
She's busy with more important matters now.

00:20:57.599 --> 00:20:58.359
What are you looking at?

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.039
Nothing to see here.

00:21:03.599 --> 00:21:05.039
Your outfit today

00:21:05.799 --> 00:21:06.720
is just like

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.720
the green frog in the northeastern border swamps

00:21:11.279 --> 00:21:12.519
that feeds on mosquitoes.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.480
Now you're glaring,

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:16.720
looking even more like that green frog.

00:21:17.359 --> 00:21:18.440
You... are quite cute.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:26.319
Give it to me.

00:21:30.319 --> 00:21:31.240
This booklet,

00:21:32.279 --> 00:21:33.920
I started preparing it a long time ago.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.359
Was the hundredth one difficult?

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:37.960
Not really.

00:21:38.839 --> 00:21:40.160
You'll know when you see it.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.359
What is this?

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.599
This is you, angry

00:21:55.839 --> 00:21:56.759
when your purse was stolen.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.440
This is me.

00:22:00.079 --> 00:22:00.759
Well?

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:01.920
It looks quite like me, doesn't it?

00:22:04.519 --> 00:22:05.079
Like.

00:22:05.519 --> 00:22:06.599
Very much like.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:08.079
My mother said I

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:09.480
had a talent for drawing since childhood.

00:22:12.079 --> 00:22:14.799
Your mother must have doted on you.

00:22:19.039 --> 00:22:21.799
This is you chasing me to give me a beating.

00:22:25.319 --> 00:22:26.240
This is you practicing martial arts.

00:22:28.839 --> 00:22:31.240
This is you holding your bottom and crying out in pain.

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:36.079
Why are you drawing me for no reason?

00:22:40.079 --> 00:22:41.160
Look at the last page.

00:22:49.079 --> 00:22:50.200
What nonsense did you write?

00:22:50.599 --> 00:22:51.680
This is not nonsense.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.319
I've wanted to write this for a long time.

00:23:00.599 --> 00:23:01.359
I...

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:04.319
My heart belongs to you.

00:23:07.799 --> 00:23:08.599
Miss Meng...

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:10.359
And you?

00:23:14.839 --> 00:23:15.559
I...

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:20.480
I should go back first.

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:36.640
I...

00:23:40.119 --> 00:23:40.920
Me too.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:56.200
So,

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:58.240
Yinglu and Commander He

00:24:01.519 --> 00:24:03.319
have actually progressed to this point?

00:24:03.319 --> 00:24:04.640
Commander He is quite something.

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:07.200
You prepared a gift for Yinglu.

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:09.559
What about mine?

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:10.880
Of course there's one for you too.

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:11.759
It's the same as Yinglu's.

00:24:11.960 --> 00:24:12.839
I'll have someone fetch it.

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:14.359
The same as hers?

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:16.400
Then I don't want it.

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:19.480
I want...

00:24:39.240 --> 00:24:40.440
just a hug.

00:24:44.400 --> 00:24:45.960
Don't be so handsy all the time.

00:24:46.200 --> 00:24:47.039
It's not proper.

00:24:51.000 --> 00:24:52.440
Remember before you went to Luo Jing,

00:24:53.440 --> 00:24:54.160
I told you

00:24:54.160 --> 00:24:55.200
I had something to say to you.

00:24:56.880 --> 00:24:57.960
What is it? Tell me.

00:24:58.359 --> 00:24:59.839
You're being so mysterious.

00:25:02.119 --> 00:25:03.240
First, have a drink with me.

00:25:04.880 --> 00:25:05.720
Drink here?

00:25:07.240 --> 00:25:09.079
The palace isn't a good place for drinking.

00:25:10.200 --> 00:25:11.160
We should go outside the palace.

00:25:12.680 --> 00:25:14.240
Consider it celebrating my entry into court service.

00:25:14.799 --> 00:25:15.440
How about it?

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:20.559
Alright.

00:25:20.839 --> 00:25:21.720
Let me change clothes then.

00:25:21.839 --> 00:25:23.359
We'll go early and return early.

00:25:32.599 --> 00:25:33.960
Yinglu told me

00:25:33.960 --> 00:25:35.480
your reason for refusing to serve in court.

00:25:36.440 --> 00:25:37.119
Although I don't know

00:25:37.119 --> 00:25:38.759
why you've agreed to it now,

00:25:39.319 --> 00:25:40.200
but as a friend,

00:25:40.480 --> 00:25:41.759
I still hope you can

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:43.440
do what you love

00:25:43.759 --> 00:25:44.960
and live freely and at ease.

00:25:46.559 --> 00:25:47.240
Don't worry.

00:25:47.720 --> 00:25:49.039
I will never do what I don't wish to do.

00:25:49.799 --> 00:25:50.480
Taste this wine.

00:25:58.240 --> 00:25:59.240
Crisp with a sweet aftertaste

00:25:59.519 --> 00:26:00.400
It's truly excellent wine

00:26:00.960 --> 00:26:01.720
I'm glad you like it

00:26:03.160 --> 00:26:04.759
Jingzhou's fine wines are renowned everywhere

00:26:05.240 --> 00:26:07.680
Among them, the Lover's Wine is the most famous

00:26:08.759 --> 00:26:09.839
Lover's Wine

00:26:10.880 --> 00:26:12.319
The name is quite lovely

00:26:13.240 --> 00:26:14.079
Lover's Wine

00:26:15.160 --> 00:26:17.359
It's brewed from the brightest flowers on the snowy mountain

00:26:17.640 --> 00:26:19.680
and the snow from its highest peak

00:26:20.160 --> 00:26:22.839
The local people regard the snowy mountain as a deity

00:26:23.440 --> 00:26:24.839
If they have someone they love

00:26:25.559 --> 00:26:27.839
they will circle the mountain forty-nine times

00:26:28.599 --> 00:26:29.599
bowing and kowtowing with each step

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:32.680
praying to the deity to protect their beloved

00:26:33.319 --> 00:26:35.279
keeping them safe from illness and misfortune for life

00:26:36.119 --> 00:26:37.680
After completing the forty-nine circles

00:26:38.480 --> 00:26:40.759
they go to the mountaintop to gather the flowers and snow

00:26:41.359 --> 00:26:42.720
to brew a pot of Lover's Wine

00:26:45.759 --> 00:26:47.319
How do you know all this so well?

00:26:50.200 --> 00:26:52.480
In Jingzhou, I accidentally contracted the plague

00:26:52.960 --> 00:26:54.160
I was bedridden for a long time

00:26:54.759 --> 00:26:57.400
A commoner brewed a pot of Lover's Wine for me

00:26:57.720 --> 00:26:59.119
You caught the plague too?

00:27:01.920 --> 00:27:04.039
But thankfully, you're fine now

00:27:05.680 --> 00:27:06.920
If I hadn't woken up

00:27:10.799 --> 00:27:12.559
would A Lan have been sad?

00:27:12.559 --> 00:27:13.640
Don't say such unlucky things

00:27:16.680 --> 00:27:17.240
Wait

00:27:18.720 --> 00:27:20.200
You just said

00:27:20.400 --> 00:27:22.960
a commoner brewed Lover's Wine for you

00:27:23.720 --> 00:27:26.599
That commoner was a woman, wasn't she?

00:27:32.119 --> 00:27:33.319
The daughter of the Jingzhou Prefect

00:27:36.440 --> 00:27:38.559
It seems the Prefect's daughter

00:27:38.559 --> 00:27:40.000
has deep feelings for you

00:27:55.240 --> 00:27:58.039
What we're drinking now is Lover's Wine

00:28:01.680 --> 00:28:03.599
The one the Prefect's daughter brewed for you

00:28:06.519 --> 00:28:08.039
I have no romantic feelings for her whatsoever

00:28:08.559 --> 00:28:10.000
Naturally, I couldn't accept her wine

00:28:14.559 --> 00:28:15.680
But what if this Lover's Wine

00:28:16.359 --> 00:28:18.000
was brewed by me, personally for you?

00:28:32.920 --> 00:28:34.119
A Lan, you're shocked

00:28:37.359 --> 00:28:38.160
I'm teasing you

00:28:39.000 --> 00:28:40.680
This isn't Jingzhou's Lover's Wine at all

00:28:42.079 --> 00:28:44.000
It's just Luo Jing's Nuerhong wine

00:28:46.279 --> 00:28:47.559
You really scared me

00:28:49.119 --> 00:28:51.480
Your acting skills are wasted in this era

00:28:59.400 --> 00:29:01.240
This Nuerhong is really quite good

00:29:01.400 --> 00:29:02.279
Where did you buy it?

00:29:02.839 --> 00:29:04.359
Yuwen Rui would definitely like it

00:29:07.920 --> 00:29:08.680
I forgot

00:29:10.359 --> 00:29:11.839
I'll tell you when I remember

00:29:16.119 --> 00:29:17.480
You and Yuwen Rui...

00:29:20.680 --> 00:29:23.640
That's a long story

00:29:34.920 --> 00:29:36.400
Is there some happy occasion?

00:29:40.119 --> 00:29:41.240
What did you need to see me about?

00:29:43.759 --> 00:29:44.880
Regarding the death of the Third Prince of Yunze

00:29:45.200 --> 00:29:46.039
I want you to investigate

00:29:46.640 --> 00:29:47.759
He might still be alive

00:29:49.079 --> 00:29:50.000
And also Matron Mo

00:29:50.559 --> 00:29:51.680
have someone keep a close watch on her

00:29:52.960 --> 00:29:53.559
Alright

00:29:55.440 --> 00:29:59.519
After... after he tested the medicine for me

00:29:59.880 --> 00:30:02.079
I... I realized

00:30:03.599 --> 00:30:08.680
that I had actually liked him for a long time

00:30:14.920 --> 00:30:16.119
So during your trip south

00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:18.200
so much happened

00:30:19.720 --> 00:30:20.960
Yes

00:30:25.960 --> 00:30:28.000
If I had gone south with you back then

00:30:29.559 --> 00:30:31.240
would everything be different?

00:30:34.720 --> 00:30:37.319
The wine is delicious

00:30:40.240 --> 00:30:41.039
Wait a moment

00:30:42.319 --> 00:30:45.079
Yuwen Rui is looking for me

00:30:46.400 --> 00:30:46.960
Right

00:30:47.920 --> 00:30:49.039
Yuwen Rui

00:31:20.319 --> 00:31:21.559
Regarding Matron Mo, I will...

00:31:36.400 --> 00:31:37.079
You...

00:31:37.839 --> 00:31:38.519
Look

00:31:39.200 --> 00:31:40.160
Yuwen Rui, he...

00:31:41.079 --> 00:31:43.039
will be here to find me soon